{"title":"소르골 전기:천년전쟁","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=NJrWl/hAC1Sg1Rl9/9eSIriOKmqQxHKxTCRwzGk&filename=th3","synopsis":"정령사:나타르 전기의 소르골을 바탕으로 한 \n색다른 세계관과 업그레이드된 스토리와 작화!\n\n게임 BJ인 희청은 <정령사:나타르 전기> 게임을 하던 도중에 \n소르골 캐릭터를 뽑은 첫번째 유저가 되고\n의문의 전화 한 통과 함께 미지의 세계로 넘어간다. \n\n진시황의 암살이 성공해 통일되지 못한 상태로 천년을 이어져온 전국시대.\n각 국가마다 발전시킨 무공비급과 신식기술이 치열하게 대립하는 가운데, \n불사불멸의 소르골을 지닌 주인공의 활약이 시작된다.\n\n땅의 결계 지쇄9경과 하늘의 결계 천봉3관을 돌파하고\n천년전쟁을 마무리 할 인물은 과연?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":193,"change":{"type":"up","amount":107}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":262,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":223,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":234,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":75}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":193,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":178,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":197,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":276,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},